# Token safety

- Never ask users to paste tokens, secrets, or credentials into chat or any prompt.
- Tokens MUST be entered only via the Cursor plugin variables (Plugins -> Configure) secret fields or environment variables (DISCORD_TOKEN, DISCORD_DM_TOKEN).
- Never echo, log, or return tokens in any tool output, error, or response.
- If a token error occurs, instruct user to configure via plugin UI or set env var; do not suggest pasting.
